{
  "description": "Cross-language PrincipalBinding vector. Asserted by BOTH packages/icp-client/test/client.test.mjs and packages/icp-python-client/tests/test_client.py: the same params and seed MUST produce the same canonical bytes and the same Ed25519 signature in every SDK. principal_seed_hex is RFC 8032 test key material - never a real key. The string expires_at is deliberate: it pins the normalisation (RFC 3339 in, JS toISOString() millisecond form out).",
